  "solution_html": "<p>Pourcentage de pourcentage</p>\t  <p>\t  \\(\\large{350\\phantom{x}milliards {\\overset{\\phantom{xxx}22 \\%\\phantom{xxx}}{\\underset{\\times 0.22}{\\mapsto}}} 77\\phantom{x}milliards\t\t  {\\overset{\\phantom{xxx}4 \\%\\phantom{xxx}}{\\underset{\\times 0.04}{\\mapsto}}} 3.08\\phantom{x}milliards\t   {\\overset{\\phantom{xxx}58 \\%\\phantom{xxx}}{\\underset{\\times 0.58}{\\mapsto}}}1.7864\\phantom{x}milliards}\\)  </p><p>\t  \\(\\frac{1.7864}{350}\\times 100 = 0.5104\\)  </p><p>Donc  les <b>activités informatiques et services d'information</b>\t  représentent 0.5104 % des exportations.</p>\t  <div class=\"wimscenter\">\t  <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"360\" height=\"360\" viewBox=\"0 0 360 360\"><rect x=\"30.00\" y=\"30.00\" width=\"300.00\" height=\"300.00\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><rect x=\"45.00\" y=\"90.00\" width=\"255.00\" height=\"234.00\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0000ff\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><rect x=\"60.00\" y=\"150.00\" width=\"225.00\" height=\"168.00\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff0000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><rect x=\"75.00\" y=\"210.00\" width=\"195.00\" height=\"102.00\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#008000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><text x=\"60.00\" y=\"45.00\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"16\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">Exportations 350 milliards</text><text x=\"60.00\" y=\"105.00\" fill=\"#0000ff\" font-size=\"16\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">Service</text><text x=\"240.00\" y=\"105.00\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"16\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">22 %</text><text x=\"75.00\" y=\"165.00\" fill=\"#ff0000\" font-size=\"16\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">Info. et comm.</text><text x=\"210.00\"